# FreeBSD vnet matrix (ROW=all) expected rows: one per line, both lanes
# (15.1 vmactions and 16.0-CURRENT).  check-rows.sh gates the merged
# shard log on this list: every row exactly one verdict, no unknown row,
# zero FAIL, PASS >= the lane minimum.  tools/selftest.sh (linux-matrix)
# fails when this list drifts from the run lines in freebsd-vnet-matrix.sh.
